{"title":"2023 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(Quick_and_Simple_Under_30_seconds)Recommended!!\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (Quick and Simple Under 30 seconds)Recommended!!</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution!_Easy_to_understand_with_step_by_step_process_so_that_you_understand_forever!\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution! Easy to understand with step by step process so that you understand forever!</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_CoolMathProblems\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by CoolMathProblems</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Using_Similar_Triangles)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Using Similar Triangles)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Animated_Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Animated Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove_using_Area-Similarity_Relationship\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove using Area-Similarity Relationship</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Magic_Square\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Magic Square</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_harungurcan\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by harungurcan</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">19</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An equilateral triangle is placed inside a larger equilateral triangle so that the region between them can be divided into three congruent trapezoids, as shown below. The side length of the inner triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/1/611d08a8c57a214b2b964bba16da8157a5b81c9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> the side length of the larger triangle. What is the ratio of the area of one trapezoid to the area of the inner triangle?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5f0d710200d86f7fe0ffc7ea4226812f1de1cf8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] // Diagram by TheMathGuyd  pair A,B,C; A=(0,1); B=(sqrt(3)/2,-1/2); C=-conj(B); fill(2B--3B--3C--2C--cycle,grey); dot(3A); dot(3B); dot(3C); dot(2A); dot(2B); dot(2C); draw(2A--2B--2C--cycle); draw(3A--3B--3C--cycle); draw(2A--3A); draw(2B--3B); draw(2C--3C); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"218\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/e/c7ed876e5e1b9f14af426a24ec0a937cf1feabb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 1 : 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 3 : 8 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 5 : 12 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 7 : 16 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 4 : 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"495\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All equilateral triangles are similar. For the outer equilateral triangle to the inner equilateral triangle, since their side-length ratio is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/8/ce81f9cd9b6b37de86f3ea54e8f5ce9b11504b54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac32,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"17\" height=\"37\" /> their area ratio is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/5/fa51525685b312007e0dd2ba8f6ed495bd3fda82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac32\\right)^2=\\frac94.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"91\" height=\"48\" /> It follows that the area ratio of three trapezoids to the inner equilateral triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/9/069af27d4198fbd943fd577218f335905538b130.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac94-1=\\frac54,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" /> so the area ratio of one trapezoid to the inner equilateral triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f11c96780381b6a2da2b585a9fb296a166154a8a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac54\\cdot\\frac13=\\frac{5}{12}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 5 : 12}.\\]\" width=\"200\" height=\"38\" /> \n~apex304, SohumUttamchandani, wuwang2002, TaeKim, Cxrupptedpat, MRENTHUSIASM, JubilantJelly\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Subtracting the larger equilateral triangle from the smaller one yields the sum of the three trapezoids. Since the ratio of the side lengths of the larger to the smaller one is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/e/80e47d95347d6e72d1b3e8a4aea3dd20082f3cc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3:2$\" width=\"32\" height=\"12\" />, we can set the side lengths as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, respectively. So, the sum of the trapezoids is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/9/da9d909d9b5a1f610a74ca34bf32c70ffa3f2f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9\\sqrt{3}}{4}-\\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{4}=\\frac{5}{4}\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"160\" height=\"43\" />. We are also told that the three trapezoids are congruent, thus the area of each of them is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/9/e89cf5744cbeddf0d2fe673c24dd3635d00c2ec8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3} \\cdot \\frac{5}{4}\\sqrt{3}=\\frac{5}{12}\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"136\" height=\"38\" />. Hence, the ratio is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/f/53f3841208900efa9fa85a6f9e03acdf8ca5e83a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{5}{12}\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{5}{12}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 5 : 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"207\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~MrThinker\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28Quick_and_Simple_Under_30_seconds.29Recommended.21.21\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(Quick_and_Simple_Under_30_seconds)Recommended!!\">Video Solution by Math-X (Quick and Simple Under 30 seconds)Recommended!!</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (Quick and Simple Under 30 seconds)Recommended!!\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Ku_c1YHnLt0?si=AtiMigHKcdyC8nw9&amp;t=4074\">https://youtu.be/Ku_c1YHnLt0?si=AtiMigHKcdyC8nw9&amp;t=4074</a> ~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.21_Easy_to_understand_with_step_by_step_process_so_that_you_understand_forever.21\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution!_Easy_to_understand_with_step_by_step_process_so_that_you_understand_forever!\">Video Solution! Easy to understand with step by step process so that you understand forever!</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution! Easy to understand with step by step process so that you understand forever!\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/VHBbqKjhTz0\">https://youtu.be/VHBbqKjhTz0</a>\nPlease subscribe and like! \n</p><p>~Srinjini_060313\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_CoolMathProblems\">Video Solution by CoolMathProblems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by CoolMathProblems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ycBjF78BAOs\">https://youtu.be/ycBjF78BAOs</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zntZrtsnyxc?si=nM5eWOwNU6HRdleZ&amp;t=2008\">https://youtu.be/zntZrtsnyxc?si=nM5eWOwNU6HRdleZ&amp;t=2008</a>\n~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/u0Qa3A3jFFU\">https://youtu.be/u0Qa3A3jFFU</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_.28Using_Similar_Triangles.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn_(Using_Similar_Triangles)\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Using Similar Triangles)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn (Using Similar Triangles)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/bGN-uBsVm0E\">https://youtu.be/bGN-uBsVm0E</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Animated_Video_Solution\">Animated Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Animated Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Xq4LdJJtbDk\">https://youtu.be/Xq4LdJJtbDk</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove_using_Area-Similarity_Relationship\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove using Area-Similarity Relationship</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove using Area-Similarity Relationship\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=92hAg3JjqZI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=92hAg3JjqZI</a>\n</p><p>~Star League (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://starleague.us\">https://starleague.us</a>)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Magic_Square\">Video Solution by Magic Square</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Magic Square\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-N46BeEKaCQ?t=3360\">https://youtu.be/-N46BeEKaCQ?t=3360</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_